#. comic438 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic438.htm:199
msgctxt "comic438#p3.1"
msgid "Bogey, look at Amp and Julie. They forever think of themselves as an old man and a little girl! The other Sheena might be the same way."
