#. comic439 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeydown.gif, sheenablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic439.htm:87
msgctxt "comic439#p1.1"
msgid "Arguing with the other Sheena might be annoying, but in the end you're the one in charge."
