#. comic443 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: nibluv.gif, ampshtback.gif
#: kidradd/comic443.htm:357
msgctxt "comic443#p6.3"
msgid "Uh, yoo-hoo! I'm bottomless too! Hello?"
