#. comic445 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic445.htm:198
msgctxt "comic445#p3.1"
msgid "Radd! Friend!"
msgstr ""

#. comic445 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, qbbeg.gif
#: kidradd/comic445.htm:246
msgctxt "comic445#p4.1"
msgid "I beg your forgiveness a million times over! Please oh please oh please oh <i>please</i> accept my apology!"
msgstr ""

#. comic445 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, qbbeg.gif
#: kidradd/comic445.htm:250
msgctxt "comic445#p4.2"
msgid "Oh sheesh... Fine, just stop touching me already!"
msgstr ""

#. comic445 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: tflame.gif
#: kidradd/comic445.htm:303
msgctxt "comic445#p5.1"
msgid "Well, maybe it's better not to push him right away. There's really no need to hurry..."
