#. comic446 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic446.htm:149
msgctxt "comic446#p2.1"
msgid "In my current state, I'm useless. Unless I'm willing to make some changes, I'll just have to give up that silly dream."
